# Security

The 9bot MCP service is a hosted service operated by 9bot.

Do not report security vulnerabilities through public GitHub issues.

For security-related reports, please contact the 9bot team through our official support channels.

## Authentication

The 9bot MCP uses OAuth 2.0 authentication.

Never share access tokens, refresh tokens, verification codes or other credentials in GitHub issues.

## Official MCP Endpoint

https://mcp.9bot.com.br/mcp
